    <item>
      <title>美FCC拟禁止中国三家电信商直接获取美国号码资源，中国商务部回应坚决反对</title>
      <link>https://111.230.153.15/news/?batch=smart-20261122-135002&amp;cat=general&amp;event=evt_b393e7441a2e</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">smart-20261122-135002:evt_b393e7441a2e</guid>
